WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:08.360
In this lesson, you will learn to test a game like a player, find bugs in rules and scores, and fix them.

2
00:00:08.360 --> 00:00:12.590
Game makers ask testers to play and find problems.

3
00:00:12.590 --> 00:00:15.340
Does the score match what you collected?

4
00:00:15.340 --> 00:00:17.590
If not, there’s a bug.

5
00:00:17.590 --> 00:00:22.270
Maybe a treasure doesn’t disappear, or the win message never shows.

6
00:00:22.270 --> 00:00:25.270
Fix one bug, then play again.

7
00:00:25.270 --> 00:00:30.750
Bug! The score should be 2 after collecting 2 gems. Fix the code.

8
00:00:30.750 --> 00:00:34.770
The second +1 was missing. Score fixed!

9
00:00:34.770 --> 00:00:36.410
Great work! Let’s remember what we learned.

10
00:00:36.410 --> 00:00:42.300
Now build along, then try the challenges. You’ve got this!
